1
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,560
Help!

2
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,200
Please let me go!

3
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,879
Do you want money?

4
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,680
My dad is very rich.

5
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,239
I'll give you lots and lots of money.

6
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:19,400
Please let me go!

7
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,719
Does your dad have a lot of money?

8
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,480
Is he richer than me?

9
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,239
What do you want?

10
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,640
What do I want?

11
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:35,159
Out in the middle of nowhere,

12
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:37,000
just a man and a woman...

13
00:01:39,319 --> 00:01:41,000
What do you think I want?

14
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:48,760
Help!

15
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,319
Help!

16
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,280
Help!

17
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:54,840
Help!

18
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,319
Stop struggling!

19
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,120
So damn annoying.

20
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,840
Grey Wolf.

21
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:52,479
Are you kidding me?!

22
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,599
I'm from Yan Li's hometown!

23
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,960
You can't kill me!

24
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:38,360
How dare you touch the Boss's woman?

25
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,879
You've got a death wish!

26
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,639
Dispose of the body.

27
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:07,280
Drive.

28
00:04:29,519 --> 00:04:31,199
That bastard Yan Li

29
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:33,079
tells me to do a job,

30
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,399
but gives me no money,

31
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,160
and no car.

32
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:54,959
Bro.

33
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:56,600
Let me borrow your car.

34
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,079
No way.

35
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,079
You got a worm tattoo.

36
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,720
What are you so cocky about?

37
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:26,480
Are you sure this is the place?

38
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,279
I'm sure.

39
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,920
This is where the organization does its dirty work.

40
00:05:34,879 --> 00:05:35,680
Stop right there!

41
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:36,680
The scene is cordoned off.

42
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,800
Unauthorized personnel, step back.

43
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,079
My daughter is in there!

44
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:40,120
Family members are not allowed either.

45
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,759
You cannot interfere with a police investigation.

46
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,800
It wasn't me!

47
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:43,480
Sun Ming!

48
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,000
Go.

49
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,319
You two, come here.

50
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:54,920
Let's go.

51
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,600
Did you find her?

52
00:05:58,879 --> 00:06:00,120
Our criminal investigators

53
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,680
did not find the victim or the kidnappers at the scene.

54
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,040
However, they did find some bloodstains.

55
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:07,079
We cannot confirm yet if they belong to the victim.

56
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:08,480
What about the smartwatch?

57
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,319
Is there still a signal?

58
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,480
We cannot track it anymore.

59
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,120
Come on, you guys are moving way too slow!

60
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,399
Hurry up, will you?

61
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:15,920
Gu Yan, I completely understand how you feel right now.

62
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,040
But when it comes to finding someone,

63
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,079
leave it to the police.

64
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:18,920
Just calm down.

65
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:21,199
That's my own daughter!

66
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,800
How can I not panic?

67
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,040
Just calm down!

68
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,040
Gu Ting is what matters right now.

69
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,000
Finding her is the priority, okay?

70
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,720
Calm down, my ass!

71
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,879
Tingting hasn't had a single good day since she met you!

72
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:32,480
But saving Gu Ting is the priority right now!

73
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,040
But we can't even find her now!

74
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,800
Enough, Gu Yan.

75
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,560
You need to

76
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,639
provide a recent photo of Gu Ting.

77
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,959
The clearer, the better.

78
00:06:40,199 --> 00:06:41,920
I don't have her photo on my phone.

79
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,519
I have some at home.

80
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,720
Just think of what Yaoyao looks like,

81
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,000
and you'll know what Gu Ting looks like.

82
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,720
What do you mean?

83
00:06:52,319 --> 00:06:53,319
Who?

84
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:55,319
Yaoyao is my biological sister.

85
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:58,319
And Li Wen's fiancée.

86
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:05,399
That's why you got close to my daughter, isn't it?

87
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:07,319
You bastard!

88
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,120
I'll kill you!

89
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:08,800
Gu Yan!

90
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,240
Li Wen!

91
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:12,720
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

92
00:07:13,079 --> 00:07:14,319
I can explain later.

93
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,040
But saving Gu Ting is the most important thing right now.

94
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,920
Every minute we delay could cost her her life.

95
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,519
You...

96
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,519
Are you out of your mind?

97
00:07:24,839 --> 00:07:25,399
He's a cop!

98
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:25,920
You're assaulting an officer!

99
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,800
Do you realize that?

100
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,439
I can't let them take me away now.

101
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,839
Once I find Tingting,

102
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,480
I'll turn myself in.

103
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:36,560
Sun Ming!

104
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,519
Think carefully.

105
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,240
Who else could've told Gu Ting your true identity?

106
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,279
Who sent you this?

107
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,680
Never mind who sent it.

108
00:08:17,519 --> 00:08:19,639
When my daughter showed me the chat logs,

109
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,439
I was in a rush and didn't pay attention.

110
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,920
Now I remember.

111
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,360
That contact name

112
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,600
seemed to be

113
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,120
Mr. Yan.

114
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:29,920
All right. Got it.

115
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,600
This Gu Yan...

116
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:37,039
He's really ruthless.

117
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,639
Captain.

118
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:43,559
The information you asked for.

119
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,399
Read it.

120
00:08:44,919 --> 00:08:45,799
Yan Li.

121
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:48,159
Originally an external expert at the medical university,

122
00:08:48,159 --> 00:08:49,639
and a psychology counselor.

123
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,960
His family does not own any major businesses.

124
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,480
His other identity is

125
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:56,159
the controller of the Tucun Enclosed Building.

126
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:02,360
Enclosed buildings again.

127
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:06,080
What are the results of the local station's investigation so far?

128
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:06,919
Captain,

129
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,559
because the sheer number is too large,

130
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:10,279
the investigation will take a bit more time.

131
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:13,840
From now on,

132
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:15,960
Yan Li's whereabouts

133
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,600
and all assets under his name

134
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,720
must be closely monitored.

135
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:19,919
Yes, Captain.

136
00:09:25,279 --> 00:09:26,480
If I am not mistaken,

137
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,960
Yan Li is highly likely the boss behind the scenes.

138
00:09:30,559 --> 00:09:32,080
Xiaolin said he took advantage of the numerous enclosed buildings

139
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,639
and the excellent cover they provide,

140
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:35,080
so he must be prepared.

141
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,480
Ordinary methods might not work.

142
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:38,879
You should not get involved in this anymore.

143
00:09:39,519 --> 00:09:40,480
Let the police handle it.

144
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,600
Hold on.

145
00:09:42,039 --> 00:09:43,120
We've come this far, and you're telling me...

146
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,080
Cases must follow procedure.

147
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,159
You are not a cop.

148
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,240
You cannot participate.

149
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:47,639
It puts me in a tough spot.

150
00:09:52,519 --> 00:09:53,320
Fine.

151
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,879
Then promise me,

152
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:59,320
you will find out the truth about Yaoyao's death.

153
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,759
Who are you?

154
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:18,080
Go wash up.

155
00:11:19,679 --> 00:11:21,159
Then put this on.

156
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,159
What do you want?

157
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:30,879
You are a gift from heaven.

158
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,799
I am taking it back now.

159
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:35,360
Is that not reasonable?

160
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,320
What do you mean?

161
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,440
You're a psycho!

162
00:11:41,759 --> 00:11:42,919
Let go of me!

163
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,879
I cannot do that.

164
00:11:45,559 --> 00:11:46,720
You are mine.

165
00:11:47,639 --> 00:11:49,080
From now on,

166
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,120
you will live here

167
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,639
as my

168
00:11:52,799 --> 00:11:54,200
private property.

169
00:11:54,879 --> 00:11:56,320
You're insane!

170
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,080
This place

171
00:11:59,039 --> 00:12:00,639
is completely sealed off.

172
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,759
The soundproofing is excellent.

173
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,759
Screaming will do you no good.

174
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:06,799
You had better behave.

175
00:12:32,039 --> 00:12:33,759
Why does your voice sound so familiar?
